O, TAKEO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHINOHARA, TETSUSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UNI-CHARM CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUWASHIRO TAKEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA MICHIYO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHINOHARA TETSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUWASHIRO, TAKEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA, MICHIYO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHINOHARA, TETSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of producing disposable coats comprising the steps of (a) forming a pair of left and right neck lines (6) in a front body sheet (2), (b) fixing a sleeve member (4) to the upper surface (A) of the front body sheet (2), (c) dividing the front body sheet (2) into a first front body sheet (2A) and a second front body sheet (2B), (d) changing the positions of the first and second front body sheets (2A, 2B) for reversing left to right, fixing the first and second front body sheets (2A, 2B) to a rear body sheet at a second fixing area, fixing the first and second front body sheets (2A, 2B), the sleeve member (4) and the rear body sheet together at a third fixing area, and cutting the first and second front sheets (1A, 2B) and the rear body sheet.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à un procédé de production de blouses jetables, qui consiste: (a) à former une paire de bords de col gauche et droit (6) dans un pan de devant (2) du vêtement, (b) à fixer une manche (4) au niveau de la surface supérieure (A) du pan de devant (2), (c) à diviser le pan de devant (2) en un premier pan de devant (2A) et en un second pan de devant (2B), (d) à changer les positions du premier et du second pan de devant (2A, 2B) pour inverser la droite et la gauche, à fixer le premier et le second pan de devant (2A, 2B) à un pan de derrière au niveau d'une seconde zone de fixation, à assembler le premier et le second pan de devant (2A, 2B), la manche (4) et le pan de derrière au niveau d'une troisième zone de fixation, et à tailler le premier et le second pan de devant (1A, 2B) et le pan de derrière.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>